From: Codex <codex@local.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] bluetooth: match UART power-management ioctls to the 4.14 kernel

Adapt the supplied AArch64 HAL from 0x5441/2/3 to the kernel
TIOCPMGET/TIOCPMPUT/TIOCPMACT requests 0x544d/e/f. The old get request
collides with TIOCGPTPEER; clock voting otherwise fails and UART
autosuspend loses the firmware download completion event.
Only 25 checked MOV immediate instructions change.

diff --git a/proprietary/vendor/lib64/hw/android.hardware.bluetooth@1.0-impl-qti.so b/proprietary/vendor/lib64/hw/android.hardware.bluetooth@1.0-impl-qti.so
